        89.95792388916016,
        343.9158630371094,
        105.78592681884766
      ],
      "text": "Screening for TB among people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        116.93798828125,
        499.9713439941406,
        128.75498962402344
      ],
      "text": "1.\t People living with HIV should be systematically screened for TB disease at each visit to a health facility  (strong",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        126.67762756347656,
        285.5783996582031,
        138.30563354492188
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, very low certainty of evidence) (12).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        147.37603759765625,
        502.89556884765625,
        159.1930389404297
      ],
      "text": "2.\t Among adults and adolescents living with HIV, systematic screening for TB disease should be conducted using",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        157.0885009765625,
        489.0174865722656,
        168.90550231933594
      ],
      "text": "the WHO-recommended four symptom screen and those who report any one of the symptoms of current",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        166.801025390625,
        514.5830688476562,
        178.61802673339844
      ],
      "text": "cough, fever, weight loss or night sweats may have TB and should be evaluated for TB and other diseases  (strong",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        176.5404815673828,
        290.5265808105469,
        188.16848754882812
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, moderate certainty of evidence) (12).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        197.239013671875,
        498.3542175292969,
        209.05601501464844
      ],
      "text": "3.\t Among adults and adolescents living with HIV, C-reactive protein using a cut-off of > 5 mg/L may be used to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        206.9515380859375,
        394.4660949707031,
        218.76853942871094
      ],
      "text": "screen for TB disease  (conditional recommendation, low certainty of evidence) (12).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        227.677001953125,
        496.687255859375,
        239.49400329589844
      ],
      "text": "4.\t Among adults and adolescents living with HIV, chest X-ray may be used to screen for TB disease  (conditional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        237.41651916503906,
        290.5265808105469,
        249.04452514648438
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, moderate certainty of evidence) (12).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        258.11492919921875,
        501.150390625,
        269.9319152832031
      ],
      "text": "5.\t Among individuals aged 15 years and older in populations in which TB screening is recommended, computer-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        267.827392578125,
        518.4638061523438,
        279.6443786621094
      ],
      "text": "aided detection software programmes may be used in place of human readers for interpreting digital chest X-rays",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        277.5399169921875,
        459.8918762207031,
        289.3569030761719
      ],
      "text": "for screening and triage for TB disease  (conditional recommendation, low certainty of evidence)​ (12).",
