      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        298.26544189453125,
        518.3935546875,
        310.0824279785156
      ],
      "text": "6.\t Among adults and adolescents living with HIV, molecular WHO-recommended rapid diagnostic tests may be used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        307.9779052734375,
        427.6623840332031,
        319.7948913574219
      ],
      "text": "to screen for TB disease  (conditional recommendation, moderate certainty of evidence)​ (12).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        328.70343017578125,
        503.8216857910156,
        340.5204162597656
      ],
      "text": "7.\t Adult and adolescent inpatients with HIV in medical wards where the TB prevalence is > 10% should be tested",
